### Create asset from frontend form
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "assetTag": "FORM-2026-001",
  "name": "Training Room Camera",
  "category": "Camera",
  "serialNumber": "SN-FORM-001",
  "location": "Training Room B"
}


### Get all assets and copy one id for update
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Update asset from frontend form
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets/6a4e1056bd4000ca7cd48975
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "assetTag": "FORM-2026-001",
  "name": "Training Room Camera Updated",
  "category": "Camera",
  "serialNumber": "SN-FORM-001",
  "status": "ASSIGNED",
  "location": "Training Room B",
  "assignedTo": "trainer@example.com"
}


### Invalid update status - should return 400
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets/6a4e1056bd4000ca7cd48975
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "assetTag": "FORM-2026-001",
  "name": "Training Room Camera Updated",
  "category": "Camera",
  "serialNumber": "SN-FORM-001",
  "status": "BROKEN",
  "location": "Training Room B",
  "assignedTo": "trainer@example.com"
}


### ===== Exercise 1: Ticket update endpoint =====

### Get all tickets and copy one id for update
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Valid ticket update - should return 200 with updated ticket
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/REPLACE_WITH_TICKET_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Email not syncing on laptop",
  "description": "Outlook stopped syncing after the last update",
  "category": "Email",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}


### Missing title - should return 400 with field error
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/REPLACE_WITH_TICKET_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "Outlook stopped syncing after the last update",
  "category": "Email",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}


### Invalid priority - should return 400
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/REPLACE_WITH_TICKET_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Email not syncing on laptop",
  "description": "Outlook stopped syncing after the last update",
  "category": "Email",
  "priority": "URGENT",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}


### Invalid status - should return 400
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/REPLACE_WITH_TICKET_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Email not syncing on laptop",
  "description": "Outlook stopped syncing after the last update",
  "category": "Email",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "DONE"
}


### Unknown ticket id - should return 404
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Email not syncing on laptop",
  "description": "Outlook stopped syncing after the last update",
  "category": "Email",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}


### No token - should return 401
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/REPLACE_WITH_TICKET_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Email not syncing on laptop",
  "description": "Outlook stopped syncing after the last update",
  "category": "Email",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}


### ===== Exercise 4: Submit ticket from frontend form =====

### Create ticket (same payload the form sends)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Keyboard keys not responding",
  "description": "Several keys on the laptop keyboard stopped working",
  "category": "Hardware",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "status": "OPEN",
  "createdBy": "admin@example.com"
}


### Create ticket without token - should return 401
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Keyboard keys not responding",
  "description": "Several keys on the laptop keyboard stopped working",
  "category": "Hardware",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "status": "OPEN",
  "createdBy": "admin@example.com"
}


